<title>AUSTRIA: NEW ALGERIAN MINISTER TO ATTEND THURS OPEC SESSION.</title>
<headline>NEW ALGERIAN MINISTER TO ATTEND THURS OPEC SESSION.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The new Algerian oil minister Youssef Yousfi is to attend the OPEC ministerial session set for 0800 GMT on Thursday.</p>
<p>The minister, whose appointment in a three-party government was announced earlier today, is already in Vienna, an Algerian delegate said.</p>
<p>OPEC ministers earlier agreed to a freeze of its 25.033 million barrels per day ceiling for the remainder of the year, with members renewing vows to adhere to their individual quotas.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 713 2002</p>
</text>
